{"unit_id":"truelove-dreamer__dsh-plugin-git-workflow#card-zh","repo":"truelove-dreamer/dsh-plugin-git-workflow","commit":"cddc8bc530b7f51e6b47d56fa3338412b4f82448","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-git-workflow 是面向 DSH 任意客户端的 Git 工作流工具插件，通过注册工具接口读取和管理当前工作目录中的仓库。它可查看分支及暂存、未暂存和冲突状态，查看工作区或暂存区 diff，浏览近期提交和本地分支，也能校验提交信息并创建提交。工具支持指定工作目录、按路径筛选以及限制输出行数，结果以结构化数据和可读文本呈现。适合需要让 DSH 助手检查或整理本地 Git 仓库的开发者；需在环境中提供 Git 和 DSH shell 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:134-176","lib/index.js:179-231","lib/index.js:234-388"]}
{"unit_id":"truelove-dreamer__dsh-plugin-git-workflow#card-en","repo":"truelove-dreamer/dsh-plugin-git-workflow","commit":"cddc8bc530b7f51e6b47d56fa3338412b4f82448","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-git-workflow adds Git tools to DSH for repository status, staged or working-tree diffs, recent commits, branches, and validated commit creation. Developers can select a work directory, filter paths, and bound output. Git and the DSH shell service are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:134-176","lib/index.js:179-231","lib/index.js:234-388"]}
