{"unit_id":"truelove-dreamer__dsh-plugin-git-workflow#feature-status","repo":"truelove-dreamer/dsh-plugin-git-workflow","commit":"cddc8bc530b7f51e6b47d56fa3338412b4f82448","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-git-workflow 的功能「仓库状态」：读取分支、upstream 及 ahead/behind，并分别列出暂存、未暂存、未跟踪和冲突文件。调用 git_status，可用 workdir 指定仓库。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:137-176"]}
{"unit_id":"truelove-dreamer__dsh-plugin-git-workflow#feature-diff","repo":"truelove-dreamer/dsh-plugin-git-workflow","commit":"cddc8bc530b7f51e6b47d56fa3338412b4f82448","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-git-workflow 的功能「查看差异」：显示工作区或暂存区 diff，可选 --stat 摘要、路径过滤和行数上限。调用 git_diff 并设置 staged、stat、paths 或 maxLines。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:179-231"]}
{"unit_id":"truelove-dreamer__dsh-plugin-git-workflow#feature-history","repo":"truelove-dreamer/dsh-plugin-git-workflow","commit":"cddc8bc530b7f51e6b47d56fa3338412b4f82448","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-git-workflow 的功能「提交历史」：列出近期提交的短哈希、日期和主题，可选附带变更文件并按路径筛选。调用 git_log 设置 count、files、paths。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:234-288"]}
{"unit_id":"truelove-dreamer__dsh-plugin-git-workflow#feature-commit","repo":"truelove-dreamer/dsh-plugin-git-workflow","commit":"cddc8bc530b7f51e6b47d56fa3338412b4f82448","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-git-workflow 的功能「创建提交」：校验非空且长度受限的提交信息，可选先暂存指定路径，再创建 Git commit；也能明确允许空提交。调用 git_commit 并提供 message。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:291-345"]}
